Let's expand the powers for $\greenD{11^x}=\blueD{11^4}\cdot\purpleD{11^5}$.

$\begin{align}
&=\blueD{\underbrace{11\cdot11\cdot11\cdot11}_\text{4 times}}\cdot\purpleD{\underbrace{11\cdot11\cdot 11\cdot 11\cdot 11}_\text{5 times}}
\\\\\\
&=\greenD{\underbrace{11\cdot 11\cdot 11\cdot 11\cdot 11\cdot 11\cdot 11\cdot 11\cdot11}_{x\text{ times}}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
